//│ ╟── The element shapes of this recursive spread are not tracked.
//│ ║  l.+2: 	  if n == 0 then [{answer: 0}] else [{answer: 1}, ...growing(n - 1)]
//│ ╙──      	                                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
//│ ═══[RUNTIME ERROR] This code cannot be run as its compilation yielded an error.

// Synthesized Any payloads retain their own generator's source, even in one block.
